OL,4,A'malicious competition' over AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut US President Donald Trump has said
OL,7,Fthat his priority is making sure the US
OL,8,Fdevelops the tech faster than China.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
